ps/2530560/ss_71abee120ba8f78e2336d38b2971565e448dac27.600x338.jpg?t=1740102550"},{"id":10,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530560/ss_af11f03d778e3f8f6190b13c8aa5985ceaa5a3f7.1920x1080.jpg?t=1740102550","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530560/ss_af11f03d778e3f8f6190b13c8aa5985ceaa5a3f7.600x338.jpg?t=1740102550"},{"id":11,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530560/ss_6f343f553e9367584f7684ffb9296ca136381c5f.1920x1080.jpg?t=1740102550","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530560/ss_6f343f553e9367584f7684ffb9296ca136381c5f.600x338.jpg?t=1740102550"}],"short_description":"Humankind abandoned Earth as it entered another ice age. Over time, those who came to hold dominion over the world were... rabbits!? Stamp, a cute rabbit with an old soul, pilots his trusty mech &quot;Junkster&quot; through the giant ruins of a frozen world in this Side-Scrolling Action Adventure.","steam_appid":2530560,"support_info":{"email":"neteasegamespr@global.netease.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong>, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":"https://www.rustyrabbit.com/"}